---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Lost" description="This page doesn't exist.">
  <main id="main" class="lost">
    <span class="sprite big" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="kick"><span class="bn">হারিয়ে গেছি</span> <span class="mono">404 · lost</span></p>
    <h1>LOST is an honest answer.</h1>
    <p>This page doesn't exist, and I'd rather say so than guess where you meant to go. A rung that names the wrong target confidently is worse than one that reports LOST.</p>
    <p class="go"><a class="btn-pill" href="/">back to the river</a> <a class="btn-pill ghost" href="/notes">the notes</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .lost { min-height: 88svh; display: grid; place-content: center; justify-items: start; padding: 8rem var(--gutter) 4rem; max-width: 46rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  .big { width: 123px; height: 160px; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .kick { display: flex; gap: .8rem; align-items: baseline; }
  .kick .bn { color: var(--pink); font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .kick .mono { color: var(--dim); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.4rem); }
  p { font: 400 1.15rem/1.65 var(--serif); }
  .go { display: flex; gap: .7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-pill { display: inline-block; font: 700 .9rem var(--display); text-decoration: none; padding: .65rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--pink); color: #000; border: 2px solid var(--pink); }
  .btn-pill.ghost { background: #000; color: var(--chalk); border-color: #3a3f52; }
</style>
